Cloud Computing:
It is basically an accesss to our own server from the cloud provider like AWS, Azure, Google Cloud with also the access to Storage, software, Database, over internet etc without actually buying the hardware physically but present in data center of these cloud provider.
AWS Management Console:
AWS Management Console is the website interface where you control and manage your AWS cloud resources(EC2,S3,RDS,etc).
___The easiest and advanced way to control it is coding(CLI) , programming(AWS API(s)) or AWS SDK.
